    text: "Connect Zed to Crossmart's MCP server with OAuth sign-in or an API key sent as a bearer token, and install the Crossmart skill.\n\nChecked on 2026-11-06 against zed.dev/docs/ai/mcp and\nzed.dev/docs/ai/skills. Zed starts an OAuth sign-in for remote\nservers that have no `Authorization` header, so an API key goes in `Authorization: Bearer`.",
